# Filament in this project

Use Filament 5 APIs. Project rules override generic admin-panel habits.

```php
// ❌ BAD — sync and branching live in the page
Action::make('sync')->action(function () {
    $departments = Http::get('https://qyapi.weixin.qq.com/...');
    User::updateOrCreate(...);
});

// ✅ GOOD — page calls the service used by the job and the tests
Action::make('sync')->action(fn (SyncWecomAction $sync) => $sync->dispatch(auth()->user()));
```

- Authorize mutating actions with policies.
- Do not hide a forbidden field only in the form. Reject it on the service or policy too.
- Add a Pest feature test for the behavior in the same change.
